WEBVTT

00:00:58.602 --> 00:01:00.903
I think that we're about
to encounter that again.

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:02.443
And I think one of the biggest,

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:04.903
most impactful changes
in the way we live our lives,

00:01:04.927 --> 00:01:06.244
to the ways we're educated,

00:01:06.268 --> 00:01:08.831
probably even to how we end up
making an income,

00:01:08.855 --> 00:01:10.426
is about to come not from AI,

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:12.736
not from space travel or biotech --

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:15.046
these are all very important
future inventions --

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:16.514
but in the next five years,

00:01:16.538 --> 00:01:18.728
I think it's going to come
from video games.

00:01:22.229 --> 00:01:23.863
So that's a bold claim, OK.

00:01:23.887 --> 00:01:26.125
I see some skeptical faces
in the audience.

00:01:26.149 --> 00:01:27.332
But if we take a moment

00:01:27.356 --> 00:01:30.895
to try to look at what video games
are already becoming in our lives today,